---
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="px-6 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width:1100px;">
    <SectionHeading label="Magic Corner" accent="orange" />

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3" style="margin-top:48px;">
      <a href="/magic-corner/ai-charging" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs" style="color:#e31b6d;">INDUSTRY</div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-white">国产大模型集体涨价：AI 公司的生存之战</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/50" style="font-weight:300;">豆包、智谱、Kimi 全面收费，深度分析谁在赚钱谁在亏。</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/magic-corner/nvidia-wam" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs" style="color:#66d9ed;">ROBOTICS</div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-white">VLA已死，WAM当立：英伟达的机器人转向</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/50" style="font-weight:300;">Jim Fan 宣布放弃 VLA，世界模型新范式 WAM 全面解读。</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/magic-corner/diffusion-gemma" class="card rounded-sm border border-white/8 bg-[#131316]/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 hover:-translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 no-underline block">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs" style="color:#ff6b2b;">BREAKTHROUGH</div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-base font-semibold text-white">Google DiffusionGemma：扩散模型颠覆文本生成</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/50" style="font-weight:300;">4 倍加速、开源、并行生成 —— Gemini 时代的敲门砖。</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
